     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">This looks like something along the lines of</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">ggplot(data, aes(x = K1, y = K2, color = grosor)) +</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">  geom_point() +</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">  facet_grid(var1 ~ var2)</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Where grosor is a factor, var1 is a factor with levels 1 and 2, var2 is a factor with levels 5 and 6. You can check out the references at <a href=\"https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366356235000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TFfg4mQ15-C1MOEak56pw\">https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/</a></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Cheers,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Roman</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
